Softwyx SPT Mod Template License 1.0
====================================

Copyright (c) Softwyx

This license applies only to files that originate from the Softwyx SPT Mod Template
("Template Files") -- including copies and modifications of those files. It does
not apply to code you write yourself in a project started from this template.

## Template Files

Template Files are the files shipped in the template repository (for example under
`src/`, `ModTemplatePlugin.cs`, `GlobalUsings.cs`, build scripts,
and this `LICENSE`). If you are unsure whether a file is a Template File, treat
files you did not author from scratch as Template Files unless you replaced them
entirely.

## Your project

You may license **your own** new files and your mod as a whole under any terms you
choose. You are not required to ship this `LICENSE` with your mod or paste it into
player releases.

## What you must do

Keep **`TEMPLATE-ATTRIBUTION.md`** in your repository and mention in your README
that the project was created using the Softwyx SPT Mod Template (see that file for
wording). Include `TEMPLATE-ATTRIBUTION.md` in release archives / the BepInEx
plugin folder if you distribute builds.

## Template Files -- permissions

You may use, modify, and redistribute Template Files as part of your mod subject to:

1. The attribution rules in `TEMPLATE-ATTRIBUTION.md`.
2. This license continuing to apply to those Template Files (and your modifications
   to them).

## No warranty

TEMPLATE FILES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.
